{"id":"n71941-1-7","stage":2,"title":"이비인후과 · 耳鼻咽喉科","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71941-1-7-1","ko":"콧물이 계속 나오고 목구멍도 아파.","zh":"鼻涕一直流，喉咙也疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"콧물이","meaning":"鼻涕，鼻水","explanation":"콧물：鼻涕，鼻水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81350","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콧물이","audio":"/audio/5b5327f66113e5b79f92.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17695","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"나오고","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오고","audio":"/audio/cf632d13758e65e79a60.mp3"}},{"text":"목구멍도","meaning":"喉咙口，嗓子眼","explanation":"목구멍：喉咙口，嗓子眼；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"목구멍","audio":"/audio/731335ad46cbcb83e35f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55850","senseId":"1","lemma":"목구멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목구멍도","audio":"/audio/44f25d7df6435b451dad.mp3"}},{"text":"아파.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파","audio":"/audio/f1eadb220a21e78bc17f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8ba5845818eda881","term":"콧물","zh":"鼻涕，鼻水","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3","entryId":"81350","definition":"从鼻孔里流出来的粘粘糊糊的液体。","pro